∬}_{D}f(x,y,g(x,y))\\sqrt{1+{(\\frac{∂z}{∂x})}^{2}+{(\\frac{∂z}{∂y})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A.\n$$\n\nFor the partial derivatives, we have\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂z}{∂x}=\\frac{∂}{∂x}(1+x+y)=1,\n$$\n\nand\n\n$$\n\\frac{∂z}{∂y}=\\frac{∂}{∂y}(1+x+y)=1.\n$$\n\nTherefore, the surface integral can be evaluated as follows:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{∬}_{S}\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}{z}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}S & ={∬}_{D}f(x,y,g(x,y))\\sqrt{1+{(\\frac{∂z}{∂x})}^{2}+{(\\frac{∂z}{∂y})}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={∬}_{D}\\,\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}(1+x+y)^{2}}\\sqrt{1+{1}^{2}+{1}^{2}}\\,\\text{d}A \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1/2}{\\int }_{-x}^{0}\\,\\frac{1}{(1+x+y)^{2}}\\,\\text{d}y\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1/2}{[-\\frac{1}{1+x+y}]}_{y=-x}^{y=0}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1/2}(-\\frac{1}{1+x}+1)\\text{d}x \\\\  & =[-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(x+1)+x]_{0}^{1/2} \\\\  & =-\\operatorname{ln}⁡(\\frac{3}{2})+\\frac{1}{2}-0 \\\\  & =\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-\\operatorname{ln}⁡3+\\frac{1}{2}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139535842 true] [17592186369683 1000 #edb/ref 17592186369684 13194139535842 true] [17592186369683 1000 #edb/ref 17592186369685 13194139535842 true] [17592186369683 1000 #edb/ref 17592186369686 13194139535842 true] [17592186369683 1000 #edb/ref 17592186369687 13194139535842 true] [17592186369683 1000 #edb/ref 17592186369688 13194139535842 true] [17592186369683 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535842 true] [17592186369683 1041 "selection" 13194139535842 true] [17592186369683 1104 #edb/ref 17592186369686 13194139535842 true] [17592186369683 1110 #uuid "54078bfe-041a-5e3e-a8ac-f41779b7d52c" 13194139535842 true] [17592186369684 1034 "\\operatorname{ln}⁡2-\\operatorname{ln}⁡3-\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139535842 true] [17592186369684 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535842 true] [17592186369684 1111 #uuid "3b609b55-3239-5299-8526-71550310509e" 13194139535842 true] [17592186369685 1034 "\\operatorname{ln}⁡2+\\operatorname{ln}⁡3-\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139535842 true] [17592186369685 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194